                            The face is drawn twice: the lower copy carries a
                            double-width stroke, the upper copy is fill-only and
                            paints over every internal seam, so only the silhouette
                            of the union keeps a hairline.  Both reference the same
                            animated shapes, so they stay in lockstep.
                        -->
